CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20070301T053228Z
DESCRIPTION:Each month\, we share our offering plate on the second Sunday o
 f the month with a local nonprofit organization.\n\nPetaluma People Service
 s Center: (http://www.petalumapeople.org/)\nPetaluma People Services Center
  was started in 1974 by a handful of community people who were concerned th
 at Petaluma and South County residents did not have ready access to county 
 health and social services. Our mission is to help low income children\, ad
 ults\, families and seniors to empower themselves thereby reducing:\npovert
 y\nabuse\nchemical dependence\nviolence\nignorance\nisolation and\nmental i
 llness\nwhile promoting socialization\, health\, education\, independence\,
  self reliance and self esteem.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T034516Z
LOCATION:During worship service
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Share the Plate Sunday
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
