UID:vh2e5mdd5v9hu5eefr6l7vec08@google.com
CREATED:20130104T004031Z
DESCRIPTION:Are you ready to hear & be heard!  Members of UUP now have an o
 pportunity to have free leadership training through the North Bay Organizin
 g Project on how to conduct one-on-one conversations. This tool has proven 
 to be one of the most powerful ways for building organizations and restorin
 g community because we learn what motivates individuals to take action. Tho
 se who come to the training will have the opportunity to use their new skil
 ls to talk with 3 or more other congregants about their passions for social
  and environmental responsibility. The fun part is that we will enjoy time 
 together while we deepen the relationships that exist amongst us.\n\nAsk Ge
 orge.   RSVP at  UUP-SocialAction@aimgreen.com\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T034612Z
LOCATION: Lydias Kitchen\, 1435 McDowell
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:North Bay Organizing Project training
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
