DESCRIPTION:<br><br>Welcome!&nbsp\;<br><br>Please join us online by zoom fo
 r our Sunday morning service!&nbsp\;<br><br>&nbsp\;Enter worship via the pi
 nk button at the center of our homepage:<a href="https://www.uupetaluma.org
 ">https://www.uupetaluma.org</a>&nbsp\;<br><br>&nbsp\;More details:We are  
 gathering online for the month of January due to the rise of omicron\, and 
 planning to resume in person worship in February!&nbsp\;<br><br>&nbsp\;The 
 zoom room opens at 10:20am for a brief time of conversation and connection.
 &nbsp\;<br><br>&nbsp\;Service begins promptly at 10:30am\, followed by addi
 tional time to connect and mingle for those who wish to stay after the serv
 ice concludes!&nbsp\;<br><br>&nbsp\;Our Sunday services are 1 hour (or occa
 sionally an 1 hour and 15 minutes).&nbsp\;<br><br>&nbsp\;The description fo
 r this Sunday's Service can be found here: <a href="https://www.uupetaluma.
 org/worship-2/">https://www.uupetaluma.org/worship-2/</a>&nbsp\;<br><br>&nb
 sp\;Any questions? Please contact: <a href="mailto:uupetaluma@gmail.com">uu
 petaluma@gmail.com</a>&nbsp\;<br><br>&nbsp\;We encourage you to sign up for
  our e-newsletter to stay connected!&nbsp\;<br><br>&nbsp\;Sign up here: <a 
 href="https://www.uupetaluma.org/contact-2/">https://www.uupetaluma.org/con
 tact-2/</a><br><br><ol></ol>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230407T064323Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Worship online!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
