 r approximately a 45 minute silent meditation.  Afterwards\, there is a pot
 luck and sharing.  Please feel free to attend and join us in cultivating gr
 eater mindfulness\, compassion and community.  For more information\, conta
 ct Andy Wallace at wallacan@comcast.net. Namaste
