DESCRIPTION:Petaluma Interfaith Springtime Celebration\nSunday May 22. 2-4:
 00pm\nLocation TBD\nCo-sponsored by: Petaluma United Methodist Church\, St.
  Johns Episcopal\, & B'nai Israel Jewish Center\, UUP\, UCC\nMary & Blythe\
 , would you like to be a part of this?  We would love your participation. \
 n \nTheme - Food\, Fellowship\, & Springtime\n \nSeasonal perks - Holidays 
 of Pentecost & Shavuot\n \nProgram Outline:\n \n2:00pm arrival\n2:10pm Welc
 ome greeting by Clergy\n2:15-3:00pm Clergy Group remarks with reflective te
 achings/prayers 8-10 min. each\n3:00-3:10 Food & seating at Tables\n3:15-3:
 45pm Table discussions structured with questions\n3:45-4:00 wrap up/closing
  with Clergy\n \nLooking forward to seeing you next week to discuss this pr
 oposed program.\n \nWarm regards\,\nMia\n \nMia Cohen\nRabbinic Associate\n
 B'nai Israel Jewish Center\nwww.bnaiisrael.net\n
