DESCRIPTION:Contact: Carol West (707) 481-7965 carolfayewest@gmail.com\n\nW
 1003 Stewardship Tips for your Annual Campaign\nwith Rev. Nancy Bowen and K
 ay Crider\n(Limited to 20 Connections)\nMonday | January 18\, 2016 | 6:30-8
  pm PT\nJoin the PWR’s Nancy Bowen and Kay Crider from Stewardship for Us t
 o explore successful methods for your Annual Campaign. We’ll look at best p
 ractices\, staffing\, timelines and tips to energize your next pledge drive
 .  How does your campaign win the hearts of your people?  Where do you see 
 and hear hope in your campaign?  Are you connecting with the spiritual side
  of generosity?  Let’s explore this together.
