CREATED:20070301T051255Z
DESCRIPTION:Weekly worship service begins at 10:30 a.m. Coffee\, tea\, bage
 ls at 10 a.m. and also after the service. \n\n"The Empty Chair."\nGuest Spe
 aker: Rev. Chris Bell\, minister at the UU Santa Rosa Congregation.\nThe wo
 rld is full of people who can make a transformative difference in their own
  and others lives if they are simply invited to do so. They need to be told
  that they are trustworthy\, powerful and good\, and offered partners in th
 eir work and companionship in their struggles. I'll use the symbol of an em
 pty chair to explore how our UU faith calls us to offer and share this gift
  with others\, because there's always room for one more! \n\nPlease remembe
 r to plan to stay following the service for our annual Congregational Meeti
 ng.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T034632Z
LOCATION:Petaluma Woman's Club\, 518 B St.\, Petaluma\, California
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Sunday Worship
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
