DESCRIPTION:Weekly worship service begins at 10:30 a.m. Coffee\, tea\, bage
 ls at 10 a.m. and also after the service. \n\n"Generosity: Three Stories an
 d a Poem" Guest speaker: Pacific Central District Executive Director\, Cill
 a Raughley. Worship Associate: Diana Spaulding\n\nThis time the G-word stan
 ds for Generosity\, and some other Great words such as Gifts\, Gratitude...
 maybe even Grace. This will be a simple reflection of why my partner and I 
 have chosen to Give at the level we do\, and what we have Gained as a resul
 t. This will be a Guilt-free\, Gentle time together\, and you'll be Glad yo
 u came. \n\nFollowing the service\, we will have a light lunch and our annu
 al Pledge Drive Kick-Off: "For the Generosity that Sustains This Religious 
 Community: No Foolin!!" Please plan to stay until about 1 p.m. \n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T034632Z
LOCATION:Petaluma Woman's Club\, 518 B St.\, Petaluma\, California
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Sunday Worship
TRANSP:OPAQUE
