DESCRIPTION:We will be hosting Our Whole Lives Kindergarten through 2nd gra
 de curriculum this Spring!  Interested parents should come to our parent or
 ientation after worship on January 24.  KC Greaney and David Dodd will be t
 eaching\, and they are both very excited to be working with our children!  
 If you are interested in having your children participate in this program c
 ontact Jim at uupdre@gmail.com.  More information available at www.uua.org/
 re/owl or through Jim at uupdre@gmail.com.  Snacks and child care provided.
