 tes.<br>We resume IN PERSON services on Sunday\, March 6th.<br>Location: UU
  Petaluma\, 16th 5th Street<br>More details for each Sunday's topic can be 
 found at <a href="http://www.uupetaluma.org">www.uupetaluma.org</a><br>To e
 nter online worship please go to: <a href="http://www.uupetaluma.org">www.u
 upetaluma.org</a> and click the pink button on our homepage.</html-blob><br
