CREATED:20130318T002703Z
DESCRIPTION:For the first time ever the four districts in the western Unite
 d States are joining together to learn and worship and be inspired from Apr
 il 26-28 in San Jose. Districts are groupings of UU congregations. UUP is o
 ne of the 38 congregations that make up the Pacific Central District.  We’l
 l be meeting with congregations from the Pacific Northwest and Southwest as
  well as the Mountain Desert district.  Besides workshops there are three l
 earning tracks to dig deep into one topic.  Here are the crucial links. \n\
 nThe first one: http://pwruua.org/workshop-tracks/ tells you about the prog
 ram and this one http://pwruua.org/regional-assembly-registration/ tells yo
 u how to register.\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T034523Z
LOCATION:San Jose
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:UU Regional Assembly\, San Jose
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
