DESCRIPTION:Join us after worship on September 20 for Religious Education V
 olunteer Training.  We will give tips and tricks for the RE classroom\, sig
 n up for dates\, and fill out paperwork together!  Volunteers typically sup
 port the lead teacher in the room\, unless they are comfortable doing more.
   If you've always wanted to volunteer for RE (I know you have!)\, email Ji
 m Lewis at uupdre@gmail.com for more information on coming to the training!
