DESCRIPTION:Each month\, we share our offering plate on the third Sunday of
  the month with a local nonprofit organization.  This month’s Give the Plat
 e offering will go to support the estimated 14 million Syrian refugees who 
 are fleeing for their lives.  Through the Unitarian Universalist Peace Mini
 stry Network and the World Food Program your gift will provide food voucher
 s for Syrian Families and helps support the livelihoods of local grocers - 
 in Lebanon\, Jordan and Turkey. Thank you\, your contribution will keep Syr
 ians alive with hope to face another day.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230118T053016Z
LOCATION:During worship service
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Give the Plate Sunday
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
