UID:ht7q32oei9fa33mqtqia8m7s38@google.com
CREATED:20130419T151038Z
DESCRIPTION:The World's Easiest and Most Egg-cellent Way to Show up for UUP
 … Butter and Eggs Day Parade on Saturday\, April 27th\nWe have been invited
  by our friends from El Dia de los Muertos Petaluma and Petaluma Paquiyollo
 tzin (Joyful Heart in the Aztec language) to join with them as one joyfully
  united entry in the upcoming Butter and Eggs Day Parade.  All you have to 
 do is bring your best smile\, wear a UUP t-shirt if you have one\, and show
  up!  We'll have a few signs to hold\, a banner to carry and our mission st
 atement in Spanish and English to pass out.  The more of us\, the merrier o
 ur parade party! Check out the UUP email next Wednesday for our staging are
 a and time to gather.  Questions?  contact Jodi Boyle\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T034453Z
LOCATION:Downtown Petaluma
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Butter and Eggs Day Parade
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
