ORGANIZER;CN=letisa_ham30@globomail.com:mailto:letisa_ham30@globomail.com
UID:jmgh86e1aa2aha7dqto1nuspf8@google.com
ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;CN=uu
 petaluma@gmail.com;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:uupetaluma@gmail.com
CREATED:20140130T132419Z
DESCRIPTION:\nI know that this letter may be a very big surprise to you\, b
 ut please consider it a divine wish and accept it with a deep sense of humi
 lity. I am giving you my trust And wish you will give me back the trust i h
 ave given you. I believe that you will be Honest to fulfill my final wish b
 efore I will die.\n \nI am Mrs.Letisa Hamzar from Cote D'Ivoire\, I am 59 y
 ears old\, I am suffering from a long time Cancer of the breast.\n \nFrom a
 ll indication my condition is really deteriorating\, and my Doctors have co
 urageously advised me that I may not live beyond next month\, this is Becau
 se the cancer stage has reached a critical stage.\n \nI was brought up in a
  Motherless baby’s home\, and was married to my late husband for twenty yea
 rs Without a child. My husband and I are true Christians\, but quite unfort
 unately\, he Died in a fatal motor accident.\n \nSince his death I decided 
 not to re-marry\, I sold all my inherited belongings and Deposited all the 
 sum of $8.2 (Eight Million Two Hundred Thousand dollars) with a Financial C
 ompany.\n \nPresently\, this Money is still in their custody\, and the mana
 gement just wrote me as the legitimate Depositor to inform me of the maturi
 ty date of my deposit or rather issue a letter of Authorization to somebody
  to receive it on my behalf since I can not come over as a Result of my ill
 ness\, or they get it confiscated.\n \nThough what disturb me most is my st
 roke sickness. Having known my condition\, It is my last wish to see that t
 his money is been invested into a very good LUCRATIVE VENTURE of your choic
 e that will be giving out proceeds to be distributed each year Among the ch
 arity organization\, the poor and the motherless baby’s\, orphanage Homes a
 nd widows around.\n \nI must let you know that this was a very hard decisio
 n\, But I had to take a bold step towards this issue because I have no furt
 her option.\n \nI hope you will help me see that my last wishes come true.\
 n \nPlease kindly contact me direct to my private email  for more detail...
  ( mrsletisa_hamzar@hotmail.fr )\n \nSincerelyYours\,\nMrs.Letisa Hamzar.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T034543Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Greetings\,
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
