DESCRIPTION:Weekly worship service begins at 10:30 a.m. Coffee\, tea\, bage
 ls at 10 a.m. and also after the service. \n\nMoney: a Spiritual Currency\n
 \nWARNING: attending this service may lead to a change in beliefs and attit
 udes towards money. This service contains explicit content concerning money
 . Not only will money be discussed frankly but frequent references to God w
 ill be made.\n\nThis sermon won the 2007 PCD (Pacific Central District) ser
 mon award in the Connection to our Larger Movement category. \n\nPresenter:
  \nJan Ogren\, MFT is a life long UU\, a writer\, and a psychotherapist wit
 h a private practice in Santa Rosa. She has preached at many local UU congr
 egations including UUP. \n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T034632Z
LOCATION:Petaluma Woman's Club\, 518 B St.\, Petaluma\, California
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Sunday Worship
TRANSP:OPAQUE
