UID:ogqu8h03agqiisjiruo5bo6vtg@google.com
CREATED:20140403T180233Z
DESCRIPTION:Let's Talk About It: Your Sacred\, Our Shared Worship\nSunday\,
  April 13th\, after worship\nAs part of the Committee on Shared Ministry's 
 responsibility to foster inclusive and constructive communication on topics
  of importance to our congregation\, we are launching an on-going series of
  “Let's Talk About It” gatherings on timely topics as they develop in our c
 ommunity.\n\nIn conjunction with Rev. Mary and the Worship Committee\, for 
 the first of these facilitated discussions we will gather to discuss worshi
 p\, your sacred and our shared worshiping together. It is a timely topic as
  we continue to explore and experience our transition from a lay-led congre
 gation to one having chosen to hire a professional minister\, our Rev Mary 
 Foran\, now in her third year with us.\n\nWe are all creating our ever-chan
 ging culture as we go\, and to do that we must--and we are sure want-- to s
 hare in responding\, giving ideas\, offering feedback and gratitude\, seein
 g where we'd like to change\, where we'd like it to go\, what we do not wan
 t\, what we want more of.
LAST-MODIFIED:20140403T180233Z
LOCATION:UUP/Women's Building
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Let's Talk About It
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
