DESCRIPTION:We have received a letter from Leland Bond-Upson asking us - UU
 P - to become his ordaining church. This decision is entirely up to the con
 gregation and in order to proceed\, there needs to be a congregational meet
 ing where members have to opportunity to vote on the issue.\n\nThis is an h
 onor and an opportunity for UUP to participate in a very old tradition whic
 h links us to all other congregations who have ordained someone. \n\nWe wil
 l meet right after services\, Sunday March 9th\, to vote on this one issue.
  \nPlease come.\n\nJean Conrad\nBoard President
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T034729Z
LOCATION:Petaluma Woman's Club\, 518 B St.\, Petaluma\, CA 94952
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Congregational Meeting 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
