DESCRIPTION:MORE THAN ENOUGH\n \nReverend Mary Foran with Jodi Boyle\, Wors
 hip Associate Jesus Contreras\, Music Director Jim Lewis\, Director of Reli
 gious Education\n\nThroughout the month of November we are exploring the th
 eme of Abundance and what it means to be a community of abundance.  Today\,
  through stories and music\, we will dance with questions of having enough\
 , being enough\, and yearning for more and less of what fills our lives.
