DESCRIPTION:W3004 Navigating Difficult Conversations\nwith Rev. Laura Shenn
 um\, PNWD Healthy Congregations Team\nThursday | February 25\, 2016 | 6:30-
 7:30 pm PT \nSometimes\, the right kind of direct conversation can diffuse 
 a charged situation before it damages relationships\, causes people to with
 draw\, or evolves into a big congregational conflict. So why do we avoid en
 gaging these conversations\, even when we know they need to happen? This we
 binar will help you build skills to navigate those difficult conversations 
 – knowing how and when to intervene\, facing fear and anger (your own and o
 thers)\, maintaining safe space\, practicing clear and direct communication
 s\, upholding healthy standards\, and affirming right relationship
LAST-MODIFIED:20160109T024545Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:W3004 Navigating Difficult Conversations
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
