DESCRIPTION:\nGreeter Training on Sunday\, Sep. 15 -- Would you like to fee
 l more comfortable greeting visitors to UUP? Rev. Mary and the membership t
 eam invite you to a greeter training to include best practices for welcomin
 g people in culturally sensitive ways. You don't have to be good at small t
 alk\; you only need a desire to help people feel welcome. All regular greet
 ers\, please try to attend. Noon- 2 PM at the Spaulding-Dodd bungalow (716 
 Bassett St.)\; bring a potluck lunch contribution.\n
