DESCRIPTION:Weekly worship service begins at 10:30 a.m. Coffee\, tea\, bage
 ls at 10 a.m. and also after the service. \n\nGuest Speaker: Meredith Guest
 \nDuring Gay Pride Month\, I want us to take a look at homophobia\, to how 
 prevalent\, though hidden\, it still is\, at its real and intended victims 
 (not the ones you might have thought) and at some signs of hope that it too
  might one day be thrown on the trash-heap of human folly along with racism
 . \n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T034632Z
LOCATION:Petaluma Woman's Club\, 518 B St.\, Petaluma\, California
