CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20070301T051255Z
DESCRIPTION:Weekly worship service begins at 10:30 a.m. Coffee\, tea\, bage
 ls at 10 a.m. and also after the service. \n\n"'Ave\, Salve\, et Vale' (Hai
 l\, Hugs\, and Farewell)": Leland Bond-Upson\, regular guest minister\nWith
  this service Leland's 5 years with UUP as our Regular Guest Minister comes
  to a close\, at least in the way we’ve been doing it. Ward Tabler\, Profes
 sor of Speech at Cal\, and Starr King School’s long-time preacher-trainer\,
  taught novices "don’t try to say it all in one sermon." He will keep that 
 advice in mind as he takes this opportunity to sum up\, and reflect on what
 ’s important\, and what it’s been like to arrive\, be with UUP\, and depart
 . 
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T034632Z
LOCATION:Petaluma Woman's Club\, 518 B St.\, Petaluma\, California
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Sunday Worship
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
