DESCRIPTION: New Facilities Task Force open forum.\nCome hear the results o
 f the survey about a new UUP rental home. NFTF will share what we've learne
 d and where we are now. And we want to hear from you! We'll do some brainst
 orming together and some visioning for our future. Munchies will be provide
 d and also child care. If you can't make this time\, there will also be opp
 ortunities to talk about our building at the retreat and briefly at the con
 gregational meeting on June 9. NFTF Rosemary Dodd\, Richard Duffin\, Harrie
 t Coyne\, James Coyne\, Dean Watson and Jan Ogren\, Chair \n
