DESCRIPTION:Community Lunch!!! April 13th\nDo you appreciate food? Do you e
 njoy spending time with your fellow Petaluma UUs? Would you like to support
  our entire youth group's trip to Rhode Island for the UUA's general assemb
 ly this summer? If so\, come to our youth group's community lunch before ch
 urch\, Sunday\, April 13th. Plates include super delicious curry\, rice\, s
 alad\, and assemble-it-yourself chai. Meals are $4 dollars for children\, $
 8 for adults\, and $16 dollars for families. \nPS: Youth group will be hold
 ing a bake sale after church on Easter Sunday. Come purchase yummy pastries
  to bring home and enjoy.
LAST-MODIFIED:20140410T194946Z
LOCATION:UUP/ Women's Building
