DESCRIPTION:Weekly worship service begins at 10:30 a.m. Coffee\, tea\, bage
 ls at 10 a.m. and also after the service. \n\n"Stewardship Of Your Environm
 ent" Worship Associate: Michael Iritz\nWe understand the many ways in which
  our actions alter our natural environment. But what about our spiritual en
 vironment? Or the environment we shape within our religious community? Join
  us in discovery and discussion about the trust and responsibility of stewa
 rdship we each take on in a myriad of ways - from our personal lives to the
  care of our families and on to our larger family of community around us. \
 n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T034632Z
LOCATION:Petaluma Woman's Club\, 518 B St.\, Petaluma\, California
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Sunday Worship
TRANSP:OPAQUE
