DESCRIPTION:We need YOU to volunteer for RE!  Parents\, non-parents\, and y
 outh!  People who have taught before and people who haven't!  All are invit
 ed to attend our RE Volunteer Training on June 16 after worship!  The train
 ing will last for an hour.  We will do a little bit of paper work\, discuss
  important ideas like mandated and ethical reporters\, and then have a shor
 t RE lesson including some teacher tips.  Your volunteerism will help expan
 d the capacity of our RE program so we hope to see you there!
