DESCRIPTION:In conjunction with UUP\, Michael and Kathy Lerner and Andy Wal
 lace host a biweekly mindfulness meditation group.  We meet at Michael and 
 Kathy Lerner's house\, 520 Galland Street\, corner of Central at 5 pm for a
 pproximately a 45 minute silent meditation.  Afterwards\, there is a potluc
 k and sharing.  Please feel free to attend and join us in cultivating great
 er mindfulness\, compassion and community.  For more information\, contact 
 Andy Wallace at wallacan@comcast.net. Namaste
