CREATED:20160301T002028Z
DESCRIPTION:Calling All Friendly People to be Greeters - March 6\nIf you en
 joyed people welcoming you to UUP\, why not become a greeter yourself? On S
 unday\, March 6 from 9:15-11 am we're holding a training session for new gr
 eeters. The greeter job is a once a month commitment to welcome actively ev
 eryone who comes to UUP\, especially visitors. We aim to have 2-3 people pe
 r Sunday who work from 11-11:30. It's a lovely way to get to know lots of p
 eople. Interested? Email Diana at diana.b.spaulding@gmail.com.
