UID:6m1fne9oh006mqlmg0nmadbsjj@google.com
CREATED:20230612T173455Z
DESCRIPTION:<span>“The Year to Save the Earth” – With powerful songs and be
 autiful projected images\, we are taken from celebration\, grieving\, prote
 st\, to learning and positive vision for the planet. Jim Scott’s lyrical me
 lodies and outspoken poetry celebrate what’s beautiful\, amazing\, and frag
 ile\, about our planet. As well as hard reality\, the message is one of opt
 imism\, with many invitations to join in the singing. Facing the urgency of
  the environmental crisis\, Jim's songs challenge us to feel\, to learn and
  to act. Suggested donation $20 (at the door)</span>
LAST-MODIFIED:20230709T040000Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Jim Scott Concert
TRANSP:OPAQUE
