UID:1k21nsggq9881shuen1985a9g8@google.com
ATTENDEE;CUTYPE=INDIVIDUAL;ROLE=REQ-PARTICIPANT;PARTSTAT=NEEDS-ACTION;CN=uu
 petaluma@gmail.com;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:uupetaluma@gmail.com
CREATED:20090427T235359Z
DESCRIPTION:<span style="border-collapse:collapse"><span style="border-coll
 apse:collapse">Dear UUs of Petaluma\,<div><br clear="all"><span style="bord
 er-collapse:collapse"><div>I am writing as a PCD Campaign Coordinator for L
 aurel Hallman for UUA</div>\n<div>President. The volunteers are working tow
 ard informed congregations and</div><div>delegates.</div><div><br></div><di
 v><span style="border-collapse:collapse"><div>The Presidential position req
 uires inspired leadership\, exquisite executive<br>\n</div><div>skills\, an
 d the ability to transfer theory into action--or just talk into measures</d
 iv><div>that make for a better world. Laurel can light up a room with her r
 eaching and</div><div>preaching and organize whole communities into social 
 action.</div>\n<div><br></div><div>For those of you who will be attending t
 he PCD Assembly\,  you will find an Introductory Letter from Laurel. We hop
 e you will come by the Laurel Hallman for UUA President Table and say hello
 .  </div><div>\n<br></div><div>Also attached are an Invitation to a Recepti
 on for Laurel at UU San Mateo on the evening of May 3 and some voting guide
 lines that you may find helpful. </div><div><br></div><div>Please call me i
 f you have questions or concerns--of if you have not received any materials
  from the Laurel Hallman for UUA President Campaign Headquarters.</div>\n<d
 iv><br></div><div>Best Wishes\,</div><div>Caryl Hughan</div><div>PCD Campai
 gn Coordinator</div><div><br></div><div><a href="http://hallmanforuuapresid
 ent.com" style="color:rgb(42\, 93\, 176)" target="_blank">hallmanforuuapres
 ident.com</a></div>\n<div><br></div></span></div></span></div></span><br>--
  </span><br clear="all"><br>-- <br>Caryl Hughan<br>Education Consulting Ser
 vices<br>(650) 692-4147<br><a href="mailto:educaryl@gmail.com" target="_bla
 nk">educaryl@gmail.com</a><br>\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T034518Z
LOCATION:UU San Mateo
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Laurel Hallman Reception
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
