 luma@gmail.com;X-NUM-GUESTS=0:mailto:uupetaluma@gmail.com
CREATED:20260420T192759Z
DESCRIPTION:Our yearly retreat is back to its usual Memorial Day Weekend (M
 ay 22 - 25) in the Napa Hills. Enjoy swimming\, boating on a lake\, singing
 \, crafting\, cooking\, eating delicious food we prepare\, and lots of time
  to relax and get to know each other better. For details and to register\, 
 please fill out either the <a href="https://uupetaluma.us7.list-manage.com/
 track/click?u=edc8c20cfba1f0fc8871ba046&amp\;id=81d8ed7cb2&amp\;e=89b7cc107
 4" target="_blank"><b><i><u>Registration form online</u></i></b></a> or get
  a paper copy on Sunday morning. The deadline to apply and pay is May 6\, b
 ut please be aware that space is limited. The deadline to ask for a scholar
 ship is May 3. Please email any questions to Diana Spaulding  (<a href="mai
 lto:membership@uupetaluma.org?subject=2026%20UUP%20Retreat&amp\;body=" targ
 et="_blank"><b><i><u>membership@uupetaluma.org</u></i></b></a>) <wbr />or L
 ara Abel (<a href="mailto:laraa@uupetaluma.org?subject=2026%20UUP%20Retreat
 &amp\;body=" target="_blank"><b><i><u>laraa@uupetaluma.org</u></i></b></a>)
  or see retreat committee members available after services in the social ha
 ll.
LAST-MODIFIED:20260420T200152Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Annual Retreat
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
