UID:shj8ke77h81p1s8lhms7p9m13k@google.com
CREATED:20160310T210947Z
DESCRIPTION:Spaghetti Dinner to Support Youth Service Trip to New Orleans\n
 UU Santa Rosa\, Friday\, March 18 at 6:00 pm\, 547 Mendocino Ave\, Santa Ro
 sa.\n$10 for adults\, $5 for children under age 12\, Buy tickets this Sunda
 y - March 13\n\nIn June\, 2016 the UU Santa Rosa youth group\, including Je
 remy West and Elliot Harrison-Lee from UUP\, is taking a service trip to Ne
 w Orleans\, LA to work with Camp Restore\, an organization that has been he
 lping to rebuild NOLA for the past 10 years.  They will spend a week helpin
 g to restore homes and other buildings still in disrepair after Hurricane K
 atrina.  We appreciate the generosity of the UU community and hope you will
  join us for this evening of fellowship with the UU Santa Rosa Congregation
 .  Please see Jeremy or Elliot after worship this Sunday to purchase ticket
 s in advance\, or make a contribution to the cause. You may also purchase t
 ickets at the event.
LAST-MODIFIED:20160310T210947Z
LOCATION:UU Santa Rosa\, Friday\,  547 Mendocino Ave\, Santa Rosa
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Spaghetti Dinner to Support Youth Service Trip to New Orleans 
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
