DESCRIPTION:UUP Women! Our Spring Women's Retreat is Coming Up March 8-10!\
 nWe are going to our home away from home in Bodega Bay for a weekend of com
 munity on our 19th (20th?) women's retreat. We get to be together over thre
 e days\, come to be known and to know one another more deeply\, sharing roo
 ms\, talking circles\, meals and creative projects\, as well as walks on th
 e beach\, hot tubs and quiet time. Costs vary dependent on numbers attendin
 g\, but about $120 (plus the cost of co-preparing one meal). There is space
  for ten to twelve people\, and in an unprecedented display of enthusiasm w
 e are already almost full\; for more information about this retreat and the
  fall or future retreats contact T Hathaway (elisbethhathaway@sbcglobal.net
  or 303-3237).
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T034547Z
LOCATION:Bodega Bay
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Women's Retreat
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
