DESCRIPTION:UUP's Guest Musician Elaine Lucia in Concert--July 21\nSave the
  date for a house concert at the Lerners' Cherry Hill B&B parlor\, featurin
 g UUP's guest musician Elaine Lucia. Elaine is a jazz vocalist and a singer
  songwriter\, whose work will sparkle in this setting. The UUP Concert Seri
 es is our way of thanking our volunteer guest musicians\, and offering us a
 ll a chance to hear more of their work. Sliding scale\, $5-$10\, with all p
 roceeds going to the artist. Questions or RSVP to David Dodd at david.g.dod
 d@gmail.com.\n
