CREATED:20160126T195354Z
DESCRIPTION:Would you like to join the 2016 Stewardship team? \nSo far plan
 ning team is Carol West\, Richard Duffin\, James Coyne\, Rev Mary Foran. \n
 You may participate as much or as little as you have time for. \nContact ca
 rolfayewest@gmail.com (707) 763-3260\n\nFirst gathering of the 2016 Steward
 ship team Sat Jan 30 7pm ( Carol West's house)\n\nPlanning\, priorities\, t
 heme\nWatching stewardship video together followed by discussion as to how 
 to make ideas relevant to UUP\nStewardship conversation training workshops 
  together\nPreparing printed materials\nTWAUUP announcements \nStewardship 
 kick off event \nStewardship conversations 1:1\nStewardship conversations s
 mall groups\nFollowup calls\nThank you letters\n\nHere is a the link to the
  recent presentation from UUA -PCD Nancy Bowen and Kay Crider to get your c
 reative ideas flowing. \n\nW1003 Stewardship Annual Campaign\nPublished on 
 Jan 20\, 2016\nRev. Nancy Bowen and Kay Crider talk about some ideas to re-
 invigorate your annual campaign and having a broad view of stewardship.http
 s://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Scp8oB01Pp4&feature=youtu.be\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20160126T195355Z
LOCATION:64 Century Ln\, Petaluma\, CA 94952\, USA
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Stewardship Team 2016
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
