DESCRIPTION:Weekly worship service begins at 10:30 a.m. Coffee\, tea\, bage
 ls at 10 a.m. and also after the service. \n\n"M.O.M. -- My Own Mother" Reg
 ular Guest Minister: Leland Bond-Upson\nOn Mother’s Day\, we will honor mot
 hers and motherhood\, we will imagine all that goes into it\, and recall ou
 r own\, specific mothers. Furthermore\, we will evoke the mother within eac
 h of us\, our own mothers in a different\, forward-looking sense. 
