 tions will be sent upon confirming you are coming .  Limited space\, we can
  accommodate 4 more. Arrive by 6:30 for finger food and chat.  Then poems. 
  Bring poems you love\, not your own\, read them and share why they speak t
 o you. Over at 9 unless we are just so excited it must go on. RSVP to apgre
 en at sonic dot net. Confirmation of space available and directions will be
  sent back.  -Dick Allen\, 415 847 9224\n
