DESCRIPTION:Attn: Beneficiary\n\nWe have been mandated to contact you in re
 spect to transaction bearing your name as the beneficiary in West African G
 hana. We were mandated because the funds/Consignment in question is up for 
 confiscation. As a Minister of Foreign Affairs\,we refused the approval for
  confiscation because it is our duty to protect the interest of our citizen
 s and non-citizens due to economic relationship.\n\nToday we made an appeal
  to the International Banking and Finance Commission\,we have assign a dipl
 omat (Arab trained). He is a Ghanian but studied in UAE and run a private d
 iplomatic firm that will deliver the consignment to you in your country or 
 any nearby country where they have landing permit/license\, where you are r
 equired to travel in person to receive this fund as the beneficiary.\n\nThe
  Diplomat assured us 100% hitches delivering of the consignment to you as h
 e have wonderful record of successes and zero failure in this arrangement. 
 And he has been using through this means to move funds discretely for some 
 top politicians and big time business tycoons\,that have big amount with Ba
 nks here in Africa since there are too much eyes on Bank to Bank transfer.\
 n\nFor further inquirings write to office E-mail: foreignaffairs.ministrygh
 ana@yahoo.com\n\nThis confidential process is never to be disclosed no matt
 er the situation\,even if you call our office no one will admit this proces
 s.If you are willing and you want us to help protect your funds from the Gh
 ana Government\, kindly reply this email immediately then you will be given
  the further processes to take .\n\nRespectfully Yours\n\nAlhaji Mohammad M
 umuni\nMinistry of Foreign Affairs\nAccra-Ghana.
