DESCRIPTION:Petaluma Housing Action Team Meeting - January 28\nPetaluma Hou
 sing Action Team (PHAT) will be meeting Thursday January 28th\, 5:30 p.m. t
 o review our accomplishments and plan next steps. The housing crisis is one
  of the biggest issues in the whole Bay Area that is having profound effect
 s on current and future quality of life and threatening the vibrant diversi
 ty of our communities.  To express interest or ask questions talk to Carol 
 Crabill or George or send an email to  UUP-PHAT@aimgreen.com  Meeting Locat
 ion: Hospice of Petaluma\, 416 Payran St\, Petaluma. 
