DESCRIPTION:Please come support our volunteer musician for the May 12 servi
 ce at a concert that same evening (Mother's Day!). It's doubtful we'll have
  the chance to see Bobby Jo in a small setting for much longer\, as his car
 eer is poised to take off. This will be our fourth house concert\, and it w
 ould be great to pack the place! Hosted by Michael and Kathy Lerner at thei
 r Cherry Hill B&B\, in a lovely Victorian parlor\, we can accommodate about
  30 people. In honor of Mother's Day\, all mothers and children under 18 ma
 y attend free of charge. We'd like everyone else to chip in $5 to $10 on a 
 sliding scale. Please RSVP to David Dodd at david.g.dodd@gmail.com. This wi
 ll be a special evening.
