CREATED:20071129T142724Z
DESCRIPTION:Co-sponsored by the Pachamama Alliance and the Unitarian Univer
 salists of Petaluma\nThe Awakening the Dreamer\, Changing the Dream Symposi
 um explores the link between three of humanity's most critical concerns: en
 vironmental sustainability\, social justice\, and spiritual fulfillment. Us
 ing video clips from some of the world's most respected thinkers\, along wi
 th inspiring short films and leading-edge information\, the symposium invit
 es participants to gain a new insight into the very nature of our time and 
 the opportunity we have to shape and impact the direction of our world with
  our everyday choices and actions. \n$10-$30 sliding scale. Light refreshme
 nts will be served. Visit http://www.awakeningthedreamer.org for more info.
  \n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T034714Z
LOCATION:Petaluma Woman's Club\, 518 B. St.\, Petaluma\, CA 94952
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:NOTE! Event Cancelled: Awakening The Dreamer Symposium
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
