CREATED:20130131T051939Z
DESCRIPTION:As we move from one year to the next\, yoga is one way of ackno
 wledging and celebrating all that has transpired to make us what we are tod
 ay.   We will open our hearts to a positive relationship with ourselves in 
 body\, mind and spirt.   This practice is open to all levels\, limping to l
 eaping.  We will meet the first Monday of every month beginning on January 
 6\, 2013 at 8:30am before the service.  The first session will focus on hon
 oring ourselves so that we are launched reveling moment to moment into the 
 next in a mindful\, "present" and healthy way into this new year.   Please 
 bring your own yoga mat\, blankets\, bolsters\, blocks if you have them- ch
 airs for those who not able to lie on the floor are available as well as a 
 few extra mats and blankets are available if you do not have your own.\n\nL
 et me know that your are coming and if you will be needing a mat:\nkcookie2
 5@gmail.com
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T034615Z
LOCATION:uup
SEQUENCE:4
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Yoga
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
