CREATED:20160428T000659Z
DESCRIPTION:Courage for Black Lives Matter\, Courage for Racial Justice: \n
 For Anti-Racist Leadership in White Communities in Black Lives Matter Movem
 ent Times\nFriday\, June 3\, 6PM (potluck) 7PM to 9PM (event)\nWe are offer
 ing to all Bay Area Unitarian Universalists\, people of faith and conscious
 \, and those who are curious and want to to get involved\, to join us for a
  rare opportunity to spend an evening with the acclaimed Chris Crass\, move
 ment educator\, author\, and inspirational speaker.\nChris will be speaking
  and training in the King Rooms on Friday evening\, June 3\, 7-9PM. This tr
 aining and opportunity is open and free to all. Copies of his latest book\,
  well his previous book Towards Collective Liberation\, will be available f
 or sale and signing.\nTo get a free e-book or for-purchase paperback of Tow
 ards the "Other America"\, go to www.chalicepress.net/OtherAmerica\nHosted 
 by The First Unitarian Universalist Society of San Francisco and co-sponsor
 ed by the Bay Area chapter of SURJ is (Showing Up for Racial Justice) .\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20160428T000849Z
LOCATION:The First Unitarian Universalist Society of San Francisco 
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Courage for Black Lives Matter: Chris Crass
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
