DESCRIPTION:Please join us for one or all of the meetings we have set up be
 tween now and June.  Five volunteers (Karen Glikman\, Jan Ogren Dean Watson
 \, Stephanie Perez\, Mark Nieman\, and KC Greaney) will be facilitating the
  sessions.  We will get to know each other better and deepen our understand
 ing of issues facing gay\, lesbian\, bi-sexual and transgender people\, and
  their straight allies.  We will also learn together how we can advocate fo
 r civil rights\, such as marriage for all.  Mark your calendars!
