  are warmly invited to a Path to Membership workshop hosted by Rev. Mary an
 d the Membership Committee. The afternoon workshop will include time for sh
 aring our stories and learning more about Unitarian Universalism and the me
 aning and responsibilities of membership in UUP\; plus\, dinner\, too. Loca
 tion: 716 Bassett St\, Petaluma. Time: 3:30-6:00 PM. Please RSVP to Diana S
 paulding (weaverly@earthlink.net).
