RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20160410T113000
CREATED:20151001T192018Z
DESCRIPTION:Born of Earth and Journeying into the Unknown - Reverend Mary F
 oran with Rachael Newman\, Worship Associate and Mary Bevins\, Guest Speake
 r\, Jesus Contreras\, Music Director and Jim Lewis\, Director of Religious 
 Education\n\nApril is Earth Month at UUP.  We are asking ourselves what doe
 s it mean to be a community that loves the earth and all of its inhabitants
 ?  We live on earth\, but where are we going?  Does earth have anything to 
 teach us about what happens when we die?  How do earth and spirit meet\, me
 ld\, merge?
LAST-MODIFIED:20211110T145004Z
LOCATION:Sanctuary
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Worship 
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
