  Sacramento!  Interested youth in grades 6-9 are encouraged to attend and s
 pend a weekend of fun and community with other UU youth.  There is even a d
 iscounted rate of $25 for first time attendees!  If you have questions abou
 t these retreats\, you can contact Marlene Abel\, MUUGs' Registrar: 707 763
 -0443 (home)\, 707 364-4526 (cell)\, marlenea@sonic.net.  If you'd like the
  registration form\, you can ask Marlene or DRE Jim (mr.james.lewis@gmail.c
 om)
