RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20101031T103000
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20070301T051255Z
DESCRIPTION:Weekly worship service begins at 10:30 a.m. Coffee\, tea\, bage
 ls at 10 a.m. and also after the service. \n\nEl Dia de Los Muertos\nWorshi
 p Leaders: Diana Spaulding and Stacey Meinzen\nThinking about Death brings 
 up life’s hardest emotions: grief\, fear and even anger. Yet death is part 
 of life and on Dia de los Muertos we embrace – with both tears and laughter
  – its reality. We invite you to bring a photo or some object to place on a
 n altar in memory of a loved one (human or otherwise) who has passed into T
 he Mystery.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T034632Z
LOCATION:Petaluma Woman's Club\, 518 B St.\, Petaluma\, California
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Sunday Worship
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
