DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20160221T123000
DTSTAMP:20260514T024000Z
UID:0v3e555b2rfof21p4gnok2det4@google.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20160221T113000
CREATED:20151001T192018Z
DESCRIPTION:Sunday Morning Worship Service - Empathy\,  KC Greaney and Greg
  Bard\, Worship Associates\n\nUnderstanding and sharing another’s experienc
 es and emotions — we all want to be empathetic\, and to have others empathi
 ze with us.  But sometimes this can be a challenge.  How much empathy do we
  feel when we hear the names Richard Allan Davis\, or Donald Trump?  How mu
 ch compassion do we have for ourselves?  At this interactive service we wil
 l hear how many of us deal with the challenges of being empathetic\, and yo
 u will have the opportunity to share your own thoughts.
LAST-MODIFIED:20211110T145004Z
LOCATION:Sanctuary
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Worship
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
