CREATED:20160108T043231Z
DESCRIPTION:Perry\, a long-time U-U (and father of UUP member David Perry) 
 will be discussing his new memoir\, “My Life at the Nuclear Brink” at Coppe
 rfield’s Books\, 140 Kentucky St. in Petaluma at 7:00 pm\, Friday January 1
 5. Perry will be interviewed by our own David Dodd. Dr. Perry’s memoir focu
 ses on his attempts throughout his career to keep the world safe from nucle
 ar weapons\, and his concern that today\, these weapons no longer provide f
 or our security\, but rather endanger it.
LAST-MODIFIED:20160109T175857Z
LOCATION:Copperfield's Books
SEQUENCE:3
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Meet William J. Perry
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
