CREATED:20130124T061846Z
DESCRIPTION:Join us for our monthly movement-centered service\, featuring a
  clear and open wood floor\, diverse music\, mostly free-form dance\, and l
 ast but not least\, a friendly community of fellow movers and groovers! We 
 will begin with some warm-ups\, a group movement activity or game\, and the
 n play music and invite all to dance.
