 ul\, intimate opportunities to hear local musicians and support UUP's music
  program continues this Sunday with a show by The Incubators at the Cherry 
 Hill B&B. The Incubators played at our service on June 2\, and joined in wi
 th our Folk Band to support music. The concerts are our way of showing our 
 support for them in turn\, so please come! Sunday\, June 9\, 7 pm to 8:30 o
 r 9\, at 520 Galland Street. Sliding scale\, $5 to $10\, with all proceeds 
 going to the artists. RSVP (or questions) to David Dodd at david.g.dodd@gma
 il.com. Facebook event at https://www.facebook.com/events/200284246785458/
