CREATED:20130509T194501Z
DESCRIPTION:Welcoming Congregation Panel Discussion\nSunday\, May 19th\, im
 mediately following the service\, please gather with us to better understan
 d what it is like to be gay/lesbian/bisexual/transgender.  Panelists will i
 nclude some of our own - Jan Ogren\, Meredith Guest\, and Mark Nieman - who
  will share their perspectives and answer questions.  A delicious light lun
 ch will be provided (donations will cover the cost).  Join us!\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T034717Z
LOCATION:The Women's Building
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Welcoming Congregation Panel Discussion
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
