DESCRIPTION:Welcome! Please join us online by zoom for our Sunday morning s
 ervice!\n\nEnter worship via the pink button at the center of our homepage:
 \nhttps://www.uupetaluma.org\n\nMore details:\n\nWe are  gathering online f
 or the month of January due to the rise of omicron\, and planning to resume
  in person worship in February!\n\nThe zoom room opens at 10:20am for a bri
 ef time of conversation and connection. \n\nService begins promptly at 10:3
 0am\, followed by additional time to connect and mingle for those who wish 
 to stay after the service concludes!\n\nOur Sunday services are 1 hour (or 
 occasionally an 1 hour and 15 minutes).\n\nThe description for this Sunday'
 s Service can be found here: https://www.uupetaluma.org/worship-2/\n\nAny q
 uestions? Please contact: uupetaluma@gmail.com\n\nWe encourage you to sign 
 up for our e-newsletter to stay connected! \nSign up here: https://www.uupe
 taluma.org/contact-2/
LAST-MODIFIED:20230407T064323Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Worship online!
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
