DESCRIPTION:PANCAKE BREAKFAST!!! February 3rd\nHello hungry people! If you 
 like pancakes and want to support the UUP Youth Group\, come to church earl
 y on February 3rd for breakfast. Breakfast will commence at 9:15 and end pr
 omptly at 10:00. Vegan alternatives will be available upon request. Adult p
 lates are priced at $7\, children's at $4 (12 and under)\, and the family s
 pecial is $15 (3 or more people). Plates include pancakes\, bacon or vegan 
 sausage\, and fruit. Tickets will be available before and after church on J
 anuary 27 and on the day.\n
