UID:2amhl4d52nhl5du6smli8bv094@google.com
CREATED:20130124T040558Z
DESCRIPTION:UUP Guest Musician\, Amy Hogan\, to Present a House Concert\nAs
  part of our efforts to support local musicians\, and to bring them into ou
 r services\, we're going to try something new. Amy Hogan\, a wonderful loca
 l singer-songwriter (http://www.amyhoganmusic.com)\, will be singing two of
  her own songs at our worship service on February 10. That same day\, in th
 e evening\, she will give a house concert so that we can enjoy more of her 
 music\, in an intimate setting at the home of UUP members Michael and Kathy
  Lerner (http://www.cherryhillbnb.com). The concert will start at 7 pm and 
 go until about 8:30. The suggested donation of $10 will go to the artist. F
 or directions\, and to RSVP\, please email David Dodd at david.g.dodd@gmail
 .com. Seating is limited!\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T034725Z
LOCATION:Home of Michael and Kathy Lerner\, 520 Galland St.\, Petaluma
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:UUP Presents Amy Hogan
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
