DESCRIPTION:Sunday Morning Worship Service - Reverend Mary Foran\, with Ell
 en Beeler\, Worship Associate\; Jim Lewis\, Director of Religious Education
 \; Jesus Contreras\, Music Director and UUP Players for the Day\n\nCome vis
 it the village of Beneficence.  Discover what happens when big change comes
  and the villagers need to figure out what comes next.  The question is how
  to find the perfect leader… is it the one with the perfect heart? And what
  is perfect anyway?  It’s a play\, a folk tale\, a story-based worship serv
 ice for all ages.  There’ll be singing and doing Sunday differently.  Calli
 ng all children to join with adults and youth for the whole service.  
LAST-MODIFIED:20211110T145004Z
LOCATION:Sanctuary
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Worship - All Ages Worship to find the Perfect Heart
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
