UID:0blk79n12msangkb0iqlhcjbuk@google.com
CREATED:20160109T024311Z
DESCRIPTION:S5000 Thinking Strategically Series: Exploring Mission\, Vision
 \, and Ends\nWhat is the Purpose of the Church?\nwith Rev. Dr. Jonipher Kwo
 ng\nWednesday | January 6\, 2016 | 6:30-7:30 pm PT\nAre we meant to be a co
 untry club for the elite\, a social service organization\, or is there some
 thing more to building Beloved Community than that? What is the uniqueness 
 of those who profess to be “religious liberals” coming together to do faith
 -based community organizing?\n\nWhat Makes a Compelling Mission Statement?\
 nwith Rev. Robert Latham\nFriday | February 12\, 2016 | 6:30-7:30 pm PT\nAf
 ter 5-6 years\, a mission statement ought to be looked at again because lan
 guage changes and the ways in which the congregation engages in transformin
 g the wider community evolves as well. How can you activate your mission st
 atement?\n\nBreaking Through Barriers with Joy\nwith Rev. Katie Kandarian-M
 orris\nThursday | March 3\, 2016 | 6:30-7:30 pm PT\nCongregations can get e
 asily stuck at a comfortable size. Spiritual growth and growth in faith may
  get stuck alongside this size stagnation. Yet every congregation has some 
 stories of “Good News\,” of opportunities where you’ve created excitement. 
 What is already taking place in your congregation where you have grown thro
 ugh change?  How might you capitalize on what you’ve already created? How m
 ight you say “Yes!” to continued growth? Learn through the model of the Uni
 tarian Universalist Fellowship of Durango\, the newest “Breakthrough Congre
 gation\,” who has grown through continued challenges and opportunities.  \n
 \nHeaven Knows Where We Are Going\, But Do We?\nwith Rev. Dr. Jonipher Kwon
 g\nThursday | March 24\, 2016 | 6:30-7:30 pm PT\nWhen coming up with a visi
 on of where we are going and narrowing down strategic objectives\, it would
  be helpful to first go over the strengths of a congregation and build on t
 heir past successes. How can you begin to map out your future–one or two ye
 ars at a time?
LAST-MODIFIED:20160109T024422Z
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:S5000 Heaven Knows Where We Are Going\, But Do We?
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
