DESCRIPTION:Rent Stabilization and Just Cause Eviction Workshop/\n \nTaller
  Sobre el Control de Renta y Desalojo con Causa Justa\n \nCome find out wha
 t rent stabilization/ just cause eviction policies are\, what they aren’t\,
  and how we can win them in Santa Rosa /\n \nVen a aprender que son las pol
 izas de “control de renta y desalojo con causa justa”\, y como los podemos 
 ganar en Santa Rosa\n \nCity Council member\, Julie Combs will be part of t
 he conversation as well\nWednesday February 10th / Miercoles 10 de Febrero\
 n6:00 – 8:00pm\nUnitarian Universalist Congregation of Santa Rosa (in Sanct
 uary)\n547 Mendocino Ave\, Santa Rosa (Glaser Center)\n \nCo-sponsored by P
 ublic Advocates and Urban Habitat\n\n\n \nDavin Cárdenas\nLead Organizer - 
 North Bay Organizing Project\n707 318-2818\n\nhttps://www.facebook.com/Nort
 hBayOrganizingProject\nwww.northbayop.org\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20160203T224948Z
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY: Rent Stabilization and Just Cause Eviction Workshop/ NBOP\, PHAT\,
  UUP Social Justice
