CREATED:20101014T171204Z
DESCRIPTION:Path To Membership - A Workshop\nOn Saturday\, Nov 6th from 10 
 - 2\, UUP is offering a workshop for those who are considering membership. 
 If you are ready to make it official and become a member of UUP\, join us f
 or this retreat at the home of Hope Stewart. This will be an enjoyable day 
 of learning and sharing our spiritual journeys with one another while gaini
 ng a more in-depth understanding of the significance of membership. Those i
 nterested in coming to this retreat please respond to Jean Conrad (765-1162
 ) or Hope Stewart (762-9331)....or let us know at a Sunday Service. Lunch w
 ill be provided. New members will be welcomed into the UUP community during
  the worship service Sunday\, Nov. 14th.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T034450Z
LOCATION:The home of Hope Stewart
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Path to Membership Workshop
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
