DESCRIPTION:Sunday Morning Worship Service - Alive with Curiosity and Care\
 nReverend Mary Foran with Director of Religious Education\, Jim Lewis and K
 C Greaney\, Worship Associate\, Jesus Contreras\, Music Director\; Lilly Fi
 nley and Elliot Harrison-Lee\, Speakers\n\nToday we appreciate all the adul
 ts who volunteer to teach religious education and help care for the younges
 t members of our community.  We celebrate the graduates of this year’s Our 
 Whole Lives class.  We tune into the words and songs of the youth of the co
 ngregation who grace us with their This I Believe reflections. It will be a
  sparkling day!         
