DESCRIPTION:Weekly worship service begins at 10:30 a.m. Coffee\, tea\, bage
 ls at 10 a.m. and also after the service. \n\n"The Sound of Music"\nCome jo
 in us for an intergenerational service celebrating the power and joy of mus
 ic. Religious Education Director Marlene Abel will be helping to lead the s
 ervice which will include performances by the kids of UUP.
