UID:3m37291k4e3o5dg5cc5oj59rkg@google.com
CREATED:20120411T162650Z
DESCRIPTION:Our monthly dance- and movement-centered service\, featuring a 
 clear and open wood floor\, music\, and mostly free-form dance\, for those 
 who seek to find the spirit in dance\, and want to experience that in commu
 nity with others. We’ll begin with some warm-ups\, a basic ritual dance\, a
 nd then just play music and invite all to dance. We begin at 8:30 a.m. and 
 end at about 9:15.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T034637Z
LOCATION:Petaluma Woman's Club
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Dance Church
TRANSP:OPAQUE
