RECURRENCE-ID;VALUE=DATE:20160117
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20070301T053228Z
DESCRIPTION: This week the congregation will be donating all non-pledge gif
 ts to Petaluma People Service and specifically to Petaluma Day Labor Initia
 tive. The goal of this initiative is to create a healthy and inclusive mult
 icultural community where all can share their gifts and talents.  One immed
 iate need is to raise funds to pay for staff to help the Day Labors organiz
 e so their voices can be heard.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230118T053016Z
LOCATION:During worship service
SEQUENCE:1
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Give the Plate Sunday
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
