DESCRIPTION:Welcome!&nbsp\;<br><br>Please join us online by zoom for our Su
 nday morning service!&nbsp\;<br><br>&nbsp\;Enter worship via the pink butto
 n at the center of our homepage:<a href="https://www.uupetaluma.org">https:
 //www.uupetaluma.org</a>&nbsp\;<br><br>&nbsp\;More details:We are  gatherin
 g online for the month of January due to the rise of omicron\, and planning
  to resume in person worship in February!&nbsp\;<br><br>&nbsp\;The zoom roo
 m opens at 10:20am for a brief time of conversation and connection.&nbsp\;<
 br><br>&nbsp\;Service begins promptly at 10:30am\, followed by additional t
 ime to connect and mingle for those who wish to stay after the service conc
 ludes!&nbsp\;<br><br>&nbsp\;Our Sunday services are 1 hour (or occasionally
  an 1 hour and 15 minutes).&nbsp\;<br><br>&nbsp\;The description for this S
 unday's Service can be found here: <a href="https://www.uupetaluma.org/wors
 hip-2/">https://www.uupetaluma.org/worship-2/</a>&nbsp\;<br><br>&nbsp\;Any 
 questions? Please contact: <a href="mailto:uupetaluma@gmail.com">uupetaluma
 @gmail.com</a>&nbsp\;<br><br>&nbsp\;We encourage you to sign up for our e-n
 ewsletter to stay connected!&nbsp\;<br><br>&nbsp\;Sign up here: <a href="ht
 tps://www.uupetaluma.org/contact-2/">https://www.uupetaluma.org/contact-2/<
 /a>
