DESCRIPTION:When: Fri\, November 8\, 6pm – 9pm and Saturday\, November 9\, 
 8:45am to 4pm\nDescription: Retreat to launch 8 week program “Beloved Conve
 rsations: Meditations on Race and Ethnicity”  Taught by Mark Hicks\, Primo 
 UU educator from All Souls in Washington\, DC and Meadville Lombard Theolog
 ical School in Chicago.  This is a powerful\, compassionate and really diff
 erent way to experience multicultural learning.  UU Petaluma is one of the 
 few congregations being invited to participate! Ask Rev. Mary for details.
