DESCRIPTION:SCUUP (The Social Club of UUP) will meet every alternate Sunday
  at 12:30pm at Aqus. These Sundays are the opposite to the Sunday Mindful M
 editations at Michael and Kathy Lerner's.  Bring your ideas for other oppor
 tunities for us to gather -- hiking\, going to a movie\, or out to supper i
 n the evenings occasionally. Please join us when you can on Sunday to conti
 nue the discussion!  Invite your friends!  For more information\, contact S
 uzanne Clarke sjclarke232@gmail.com or 707-364-6298 and Katherine Cook kcoo
 kie25@gmail.com or 951-901-9222
