DESCRIPTION:With the turning of the year we join with UCC to consider our i
 nward journeys and what we hope to bring into the world in the New Year.  C
 o-led by Reverend Mary and Reverend Blythe.  Starting at 5:30 we will walk 
 the spiral of light created by candles marking the path in the outdoors – g
 oing into the center and returning.  Followed by potluck dinner and convers
 ation.\n
