DESCRIPTION:Weekly worship service begins at 10:30 a.m. Coffee\, tea\, bage
 ls at 10 a.m. and also after the service. \n\n"Reborn\, With a Derelict As 
 My Midwife" Regular Guest Minister: Leland Bond-Upson\nRebirth can come in 
 many forms and sometimes from unlikely sources. As Mother Nature refreshes 
 the Earth on her reliable schedule\, let us consider the less predictable a
 nd often messier ways in which we ourselves experience emergence\, new begi
 nnings\, and transformation.
LAST-MODIFIED:20230110T034632Z
LOCATION:Petaluma Woman's Club\, 518 B St.\, Petaluma\, California
