DESCRIPTION:UUP's Birthday!\nCovenanting was Sunday Oct 27\, 2002. We launc
 hed UUP as a congregation in the sense that the original members signed the
  membership book and covenanted to build a congregation together. We sent f
 ormal invitations to the PCD\, UU Marin\, UU Santa Rosa\, and the UUMA too.
  And we served a sit-down lunch to about 50 people. KC planned the lunch an
 d T\, Rima\, David\, and Diana planned the service
