DESCRIPTION:Hello\, \n\nPardon my mode of communication and kindly get back
  to me.\n\nI am Mrs. Chantal Doue\, the wife of General Mathias Doue\, Chie
 f of Staff Army Defense and Security Forces (FDS)\, Republic of Côte d'Ivoi
 re. Who has been ill for many months and after died on Thursday morning\, M
 arch 23 2017\, in a clinic at Casablanca Morocco.\n\nAfter the burial of my
  late husband. I am having problems with the government and executives of t
 heir conglomerate on corrupt allegations leveled on my late husband when he
  was on duty before his death\, which are basically untrue.\n\nHowever\, I 
 have a legitimate business offer for you regarding some secret funds deposi
 ted somewhere in Europe for a safe-keeping\, totaling the sum of USD$16\,20
 0.000.00 (Sixteen Million and Two Hundred Thousand United States Dollars On
 ly). I want these funds to be released to you for any investment you wish t
 o embark upon for a time period of ten (10) years before refunding it back 
 to my family\, since my husband is death and for government not to notice o
 f these funds.\n\nFurthermore\, I will be ready to negotiate terms with you
 \, if I know your financial capability\, experience and investment preposit
 ion\, projections you wish to utilize this funds on\, hence\, I will direct
  you to the useful contact\, where these process will be concluded within m
 atter of days.\n\nFinally\, I will furnish you with more information when I
  receive a respond from you.\n\nYours sincerely\,\nMrs. Chantal Doue.
